  "description": "One real OpenCode 2.3.0 session, recorded with opencode/big-pickle on the Ledger arena project of ademark, working through ademark's task prompts (B3, C1 W1-W4, C2 F1-F3) and one follow-on prompt, redacted. Every session holds that recording's turns in order, repeated end to end with fresh ids and later times until it reaches its cut at a whole turn: the control is the first turn, each sized session the fewest turns at or above its nominal size, and long-thread-2000 the fewest turns holding at least 2,000 messages. Sessions are created in the listed order, so a list grouped by workspace and a list sorted by recency show them in one order: workspace-b newest first, then workspace-a newest first, with the long thread below the control."
